<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia to start national housing company.</title>
<headline>Malaysia to start national housing company.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia will set up a national housing company to accelerate the programme for low and medium-cost housing, Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company, which will have a start-up capital of 1.0 billion ringgit, would assist developers build more low and medium-cost houses and provide more opportunities for people to own houses, Anwar said when presenting the 1997 budget in parliament.</p>
</text>
